tinacloud-auth-login(1) -- Login to a TinaCloud account
=======================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Authenticate against TinaCloud.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud auth login`

## EXAMPLES

Open the browser sign-in flow:

	$ tinacloud auth login

After completing sign-in in the browser, verify the active account:

	$ tinacloud auth status

